            <div class="card-glass-glow"></div>
            <div class="card-meta">
              <span class="exp-date-chip" data-i18n="exp_media_date">Jan 2026 – Present <span class="pulse-dot"></span></span>
              <span class="company-badge text-secondary" data-i18n="exp_media_company">So Care</span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="exp-role-title" data-i18n="exp_media_title">Media Buyer & Content Strategist</h4>
            <ul class="exp-bullet-list">
              <li data-i18n="exp_media_bullet1">Orchestrated high-conversion performance marketing campaigns, achieving a 250% increase in total revenue.</li>
              <li data-i18n="exp_media_bullet2">Engineered a comprehensive content strategy, producing 30+ custom designs and creative reels tailored for maximum engagement.</li>
              <li data-i18n="exp_media_bullet3">Bridged media buying and creative execution by developing strategic content directly aligned with campaign performance goals.</li>
